 "jokes": [
  {
   "text": "Nirvana's folder in your Drive is still empty, {n}. Kurt would say “come as you are”, but maybe come with a chord sheet.",
   "date": "2026-10-12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your tuner has seen things, {n}. Mostly a low E that thinks it's a D. Tap Listen and set it free.",
   "date": "2026-10-12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Green Day wrote three chords and sold millions. You know way more than three, {n}. No pressure.",
   "date": "2026-10-12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Tuna rhymes at 100 words a minute. Your chord changes can manage four a bar, {n}. Probably.",
   "date": "2026-10-12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your guitar case has been closed so long it's started a podcast, {n}. Episode one: “Is anyone out there?”",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "The tuner is warmed up, the capo is ready and the pick is right there. The only thing missing is you, {n}.",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Beatles needed four people to make a band. You only need one guitar and 15 minutes, {n}.",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Brian May built his own guitar from a fireplace. You just have to pick yours up off the stand, {n}.",
   "date": "2026-10-14"
  }
